CRAP = CC² · (1−cov)³ + CC.

So to hit CRAP ≤ 8:
- If fully covered (cov=1): CRAP = CC. So CC ≤ 8 with full coverage → CRAP ≤ 8.
- Or CC with partial coverage: CC²·(1−cov)³ + CC ≤ 8.

Current numbers make sense now:
- handleReworkBlocked: CC 15, cov 77.8% → 225·(0.222)³ + 15 = 225·0.01094 + 15 = 2.46+15 = 17.46 ≈ 17.5 ✓
- buildReviewStateMd: CC 19, cov 90.6% → 361·(0.094)³+19 = 361·0.00083+19 = 0.3+19 = 19.3 ✓
- parseMarkers: CC 20, cov 96.4% → 400·(0.0357)³+20 = 0.018+20 ≈ 20.0 ✓
- getGitHubRepoInfo: CC 4, cov 0% → 16+4 = 20 ✓

